d3215c357780ff5","quote":"The net sales decrease on a constant currency basis for the three months ended June 30, 2026 was driven by lower volumes of OIS products in all regions primarily due to the absence of the Byte business in the Americas, lower volumes of CTS products in the Americas, lower volumes of EDS products in EMEA, and unfavorable pricing in EMEA and APAC across all segments. The decrease was partially offset by favorable pricing in the Americas, higher volumes of CTS products in APAC, and higher volumes of Wellspect products driven by new product introductions.","context":"Total net sales","section":"RESULTS OF OPERATIONS, THREE AND SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2026 COMPARED TO THREE AND SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2025","block":312,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000818479-26-000255","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0000818479","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/818479/000081847926000255/xray-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5b0daf5857903b2ffe75bd4fbae7c6ba9120cbc785b4afecafffd167aeec4b8e.bin","sha256":"5b0daf5857903b2ffe75bd4fbae7c6ba9120cbc785b4afecafffd167aeec4b8e"}},{"id":"546d680e9d0a803cc5f6e1a0457f8df74a3cf70256b3e4f5002e023cfdd3efe9","quote":"The net sales decrease on a constant currency basis for the six months ended June 30, 2026 was driven by lower volumes in the Americas across all products, including the absence of the Bye business, lower volumes of EDS and OIS products in EMEA, and unfavorable pricing of CTS products in EMEA. The decrease was partially offset by favorable pricing in the Americas and higher volumes of Wellspect products primarily driven by new product introductions.","context":"The net sales decrease on a constant currency basis for the three months ended June 30, 2026 was driven by lower volumes of OIS products in all regions primarily due to the absence of the Byte business in the Ame