nt currency basis for the three months ended June 30, 2026 was driven by lower volumes of OIS products in all regions primarily due to the absence of the Byte business in the Americas, lower volumes of CTS products in the Americas, lower volumes of EDS products in EMEA, and unfavorable pricing in EMEA and APAC across all segments. The decrease was partially offset by favorable pricing in the Americas, higher volumes of CTS products in APAC, and higher volumes of Wellspect products driven by new product introductions.","section":"RESULTS OF OPERATIONS, THREE AND SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2026 COMPARED TO THREE AND SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2025","block":313,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000818479-26-000255","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0000818479","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/818479/000081847926000255/xray-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5b0daf5857903b2ffe75bd4fbae7c6ba9120cbc785b4afecafffd167aeec4b8e.bin","sha256":"5b0daf5857903b2ffe75bd4fbae7c6ba9120cbc785b4afecafffd167aeec4b8e"}},{"id":"190ae1656354a41126a8e25d03ccc84b81b482f3d2def240795c6334f5c7b522","quote":"The increase in gross profit as a percentage of net sales for the three months ended June 30, 2026 was driven by tariff refunds and favorable foreign currency impacts. The increase was partially offset by lower volumes in the OIS and EDS segments, unfavorable product mix, higher expenses related to tariffs, and the unfavorable pricing as noted in the Net Sales by Segment section.","context":"Percentages are based on actual values and may not reconcile due to rounding.","section":"RESULTS OF OPERATIONS, THREE AND SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2026 COMPARED TO THREE AND SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2025","block":329,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000818479-26